-## Branded headline templates (helper 0.10.0)
+## Branded headline templates (helper 0.10.1)
+
+Social supports an explicit per-clip `look.title.enabled=false` appearance rerender.
+It forces `captions.hook_title=false` in the same disposable profile, preserves
+caption/music/closing settings and original-project rendering. Disabling is
+currently per-clip only: new-clip generation with disabled title fails explicitly
+with HEADLINE_DISABLED_GENERATION_UNSUPPORTED. Social refuses saving a disabled
+show default. Template defaults remain independently saveable and reversible.
+
